msgstr "Riadok bankového výpisu"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_invoice/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"Cash payments for this document total %(total).2f €, above the 5 000 € limit "
"of § 4 zákona č. 394/2012 Z. z. Parts of one payment are added together (§ 6 "
"ods. 2). Check that an exemption under § 8 applies, or pay by bank transfer."
msgstr ""
"Platby v hotovosti za tento doklad spolu dosahujú %(total).2f €, čo je nad "
"limitom 5 000 € podľa § 4 zákona č. 394/2012 Z. z. Časti jednej platby sa "
"spočítavajú (§ 6 ods. 2). Overte, či sa uplatní výnimka podľa § 8, alebo "
"zaplaťte bankovým prevodom."

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_sk_invoice.report_invoice_document_sk
msgid "DIČ:"
msgstr "DIČ:"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_sk_legal_note_manual
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_note_manual
msgid ""
"Free-text statutory note printed on the SK invoice in addition to any auto-"
"detected phrase (e.g. a specific exemption reference)."
msgstr ""
"Voľný zákonný text tlačený na slovenskej faktúre navyše k automaticky "
"zisteným formuláciám (napr. odkaz na konkrétne oslobodenie)."

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_sk_legal_note_manual
