msgstr "Upozornenie na limit platieb v hotovosti"

#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_sk_legal_notes
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_notes
msgid ""
"Mandatory §74 phrases printed on the invoice — auto-detected from the taxes "
"and the customer's country, plus the manual note."
msgstr ""
"Povinné formulácie podľa § 74 tlačené na faktúre — automaticky zistené z "
"daní a krajiny odberateľa, plus ručná poznámka."

